  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thai basil fried rice serves 2 and takes about 15 minutes. It combines the technique of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "jasmine rice",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "jasmine-rice"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " fried in a hot wok with the bold flavours of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thai basil",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "thai-basil"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and chilli. Like all fried rice, it requires day-old cold rice and the hottest heat your hob can produce."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Add the Thai basil off the heat. The residual warmth of the rice wilts it perfectly without turning it bitter."
          }
        ]
      },
